    "interpretation": "Pooled log-log correlation is negative, but the within-location FE estimate is positive (0.244). The negative pooled association is therefore largely a between-location artefact: within a postcode and year, larger recorded area is associated with a *higher* price. Scope is standard residential lots (100-5000 sqm, 0 rows / 0.0% excluded as implausible or acreage), so this does not extend to acreage or semi-rural parcels."
